  47+ 6DC5 DD 21 DF 94      ld   ix, flags
  48+ 6DC9 DD CB 00 86      res  $00, (ix)
  49+ 6DCD
  50+ 6DCD ED 4B D7 94      ld   bc, (PlayerPos)
